# Screens & Routing

## Route Groups

- `(auth)/` — sign-in, sign-up, OTP, complete-profile, splash
- `(app)/` — main tabs defined in `app/(app)/_layout.tsx` (Home, Cells, People, Follow-up, Leaders, Settings)
- Hidden tab routes use `href: null` (announcements, notifications, profile)

## Auth Routing

Root `app/_layout.tsx` owns auth redirects — do not duplicate redirect logic in individual screens:
splash → guest home | sign-in | complete-profile | app home

## Screen Guidelines

- Keep screens thin: compose from `components/`, fetch via hooks
- Use `router.push` / `router.replace` from `expo-router`; prefer `replace` after auth state changes
- Use `SharedBody`, `SharedSectionHeader`, `SharedSearchBar` for consistent layout
- Check `useAuthStore()` for user/guest state; gate protected UI with `<Can>` or early returns
- Respect `featureFlags` before showing pilot tabs/features (e.g. Cells)

## File Naming

- Tab screens: `app/(app)/<feature>/index.tsx`
- Dynamic routes: `[id].tsx`, `[sessionId].tsx`
- Layouts: `_layout.tsx` per segment
